{"asset_key":"timeline/quest_story_10105050","episode":"timeline","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10105050","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:6:1010505001:0":{"text":"이상하네요... 저기 두 수비병의 갑옷이 전에 본 것과는 좀 다르지 않나요?","source_cn":"奇怪……那两个守卫的盔甲，是不是和之前见到的都不太一样？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x678565CC2177976D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1010505002:0":{"text":"로드 프란츠의 직속 수비병도, 고용된 용병도 아닌 것 같아요.","source_cn":"他们不像是弗朗茨的直属卫兵，也不像是那些雇佣兵。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7B9C1DD221FCBFA9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1010505003:0":{"text":"<style=\"highlight\">블랙골드 상회</style>에요!","source_cn":"是<style=highlight>黑金商会</sty...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x569D8F9B8848FDDD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1010505004:0":{"text":"확실해요... 제가 저 마크를 알고 있어요!","source_cn":"错不了……我认识他们胸前的标志。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3C2F3E1BD61C91C6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1010505005:0":{"text":"저건 <style=\"highlight\">블랙골드 상회</style>의 각인이에요!","source_cn":"那是<style=highlight>黑金商会</st...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA1243CF4E1FFCB2C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1010505006:0":{"text":"로드 프란츠를 도와 비밀통로를 지키고 있는 걸까요?","source_cn":"既然洞窟里有密道，难道他们在帮弗朗茨看守密道？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x820BA36BA2B449DB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1010505007:0":{"text":"무슨 상관이에요. 공격하면 사실대로 말하겠죠.","source_cn":"管他呢，打一顿就该招了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD2F2DDAD4E73B374","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1010505008:0":{"text":"잠깐만요! 우리 목표는 저택 침입이에요. 여기서 싸우면 들켜버린다고요!","source_cn":"等等！别忘了我们要潜入宅邸，这会儿打起来，不就暴露行踪了吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x431C1E7F1F1783EC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1010505009:0":{"text":"다들 진정해요! 신중하게 행동해야 한단 말이에요.","source_cn":"都给我冷静点！要谨慎行事。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x09C2B66936C861FD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1010505010:0":{"text":"그냥 농담 한 번 해본 거야. 그 정도는 나도 알고 있어.","source_cn":"我只是开个玩笑，用不着你提醒。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8FA8DB1040AADF72","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1010505011:0":{"text":"정면충돌이 안 된다면 유인책이라도 써야겠군요.","source_cn":"既然不能采取强硬手段，只能想个办法把他们引开了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5D3D6532648A95AD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1010505012:0":{"text":"제가 갈게요! 제가 수비병을 유인할 테니 그 틈을 타 비밀통로로 들어가세요.","source_cn":"让我去吧！我来想办法引开守卫，你们找机会溜进密道。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFFEA6675112ABA70","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1010505013:0":{"text":"어린이는 나서지 마시고~ 이런 위험한 일은 어른인 저에게 맡기라고요.","source_cn":"你一个小孩子，老老实实待着吧。这种危险的事情还是交给我。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x50D5D3F50700774B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1010505014:0":{"text":"발렌 씨, 저들은 황금 초대장을 가진 저를 어떻게 하지 못해요. 그러니까 저보다 더 적합한 사람은 없을 거예요.","source_cn":"维伦先生，我手上有黄金邀请函，他们不敢拿我怎么样，没人...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9615C9AF4AC3BD20","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1010505015:0":{"text":"게다가 전 여러분께 보답을 하려고 따라왔으니, 제게 맡겨주세요!","source_cn":"何况，正因为我想报答你们，所以才决定跟来，请你们理解。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xFB7994B5C0FE7511","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"게다가 전 여러분께 보답을 하려고 따라왔으니, 제게 맡겨주세요!","female":"게다가 전 여러분께 보답을 하려고 따라왔으니, 제게 맡겨주세요!","variant_male_record_index":"96866","variant_female_record_index":"96867","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:23:1010505015":{"text":"게다가 전 여러분께 보답을 하려고 따라왔으니, 제게 맡겨주세요!","source_cn":"何况，正因为我想报答你们，所以才决定跟来，请你们理解。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xFB7994B5C0FE7511","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"게다가 전 여러분께 보답을 하려고 따라왔으니, 제게 맡겨주세요!","female":"게다가 전 여러분께 보답을 하려고 따라왔으니, 제게 맡겨주세요!","variant_male_record_index":"96866","variant_female_record_index":"96867","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1010505016:0":{"text":"걱정하지 마세요. 저는 재물운 뿐만 아니라 다른 운도 따르는 사람이니까요.","source_cn":"放心吧，我不仅财运好，其他方面的运气也很好。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x5127D60CDBCFEF5D","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"걱정하지 마세요. 저는 재물운 뿐만 아니라 다른 운도 따르는 사람이니까요.","female":"걱정하지 마세요. 저는 재물운 뿐만 아니라 다른 운도 따르는 사람이니까요.","variant_male_record_index":"96868","variant_female_record_index":"96869","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:27:1010505018:0":{"text":"로완은 깊은 심호흡 후 동굴 앞을 막고 있는 두 명을 향해 걸어갔다.","source_cn":"罗万做了几个深呼吸，独自走向了堵在洞窟前方的那两个人","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x60A699E9507F7BFE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1010505019:0":{"text":"안녕하세요! 길 좀 물을게요. \n로드 프란츠님의 저택으로 가려면 어느 방향으로 가야 하나요? <style=\"highlight\">황금 연회</style>에 참석하려고 하는데요.","source_cn":"你们好！我想问个路。\\n请问弗朗茨的宅邸在哪个方向？我...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6125AA00EB0C7CB6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1010505020:0":{"text":"이건 제가 받은 초대장이고요.","source_cn":"请看，这是我收到的邀请函。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA936EA15C487A0B8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:31:1010505021:0":{"text":"그 종이 쪼가리는 뭐야? 당장 꺼져!","source_cn":"别给我看那种废纸，快滚！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDA756E3E2E91D280","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:32:1010505022:0":{"text":"자, 잠깐만요! 혹시 길을 모르시나요?","source_cn":"等、等等！你们也不认路？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9DB33991F8F05F7E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:33:1010505023:0":{"text":"전 오늘 저녁 로드 프란츠님의 저택에서 열리는 연회에 초대받았다니까요?","source_cn":"你们知不知道弗朗茨的宅邸今晚会举办宴会？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD9299DFABFBEF4C2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:34:1010505024:0":{"text":"이봐, 꼬맹이! 무슨 말이 그렇게 많아? 난 네 질문에 대답해야 할 의무가 없어!","source_cn":"小鬼，你问题真多！我没有任何义务回答你！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x71F965FF14B91182","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:35:1010505025:0":{"text":"화... 화화내지 마세요! 전 그저 길을 물어보려던 것 뿐이었어요...","source_cn":"别别别……别生气啊。我只想问问路……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB580C149FD5C2377","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:36:1010505026:0":{"text":"어서 썩- 꺼지라고 했지! 계속 귀찮게 굴면 혼쭐을 내줄 테다!","source_cn":"我已经说了！快——滚——！再不滚，可别怪我不客气！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x441133EF5D5F8F9B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:23:0:1":{"text":"조심해야 해","source_cn":"你要小心点","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xEBFD455A3168DF3F","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"조심해야 해","female":"조심해야 해","variant_male_record_index":"58556","variant_female_record_index":"58557","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:38:1010505017:0":{"text":"어쨌든 저는 미스릴 상회의 후계자니 이 정도쯤은 믿고 맡기셔도 돼요.","source_cn":"我好歹是秘银商会的少东家，这点小事，你尽管相信我吧。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xEAB2D49AB9537F21","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"어쨌든 저는 미스릴 상회의 후계자니 이 정도쯤은 믿고 맡기셔도 돼요.","female":"어쨌든 저는 미스릴 상회의 후계자니 이 정도쯤은 믿고 맡기셔도 돼요.","variant_male_record_index":"96870","variant_female_record_index":"96871","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:23:1:2":{"text":"할 수 있겠어?","source_cn":"你能搞定吗？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x65063E3166FC5300","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"할 수 있겠어?","female":"할 수 있겠어?","variant_male_record_index":"58558","variant_female_record_index":"58559","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:39:1010521:0":{"text":"브루잉 골든 장원으로 통하는 비밀 통로에 수많은 수비병이 있다.","source_cn":"通往酿金庄园的密道中，也有不少守卫。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4F39B8A1D41E63EA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:科丝蒂":{"text":"카세디아","source":"科丝蒂","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:罗万":{"text":"로완","source":"罗万","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:维伦":{"text":"발렌","source":"维伦","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:洛桑":{"text":"로잔","source":"洛桑","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:黑屏":{"text":"블랙 스크린","source":"黑屏","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:黑金打手":{"text":"블랙골드 경호원","source":"黑金打手","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":35,"localized_text_count":30,"speaker_count":6}}